// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// MARKS, not fields.
//
// Everything soft in this_ renderer is a smoothstep of a smooth field, which is
// band-limited by construction. Measured against the plate, the render holds
// about half_ its energy at every scale below 64 px, and sharpening does not fix
